From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grimtickle-overlay <overlay@localhost>
Date: Sun Nov 1 14:50:00 2026 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tpm: tis-spi: match CIX Sky1 SPT0001/SPT0002 ACPI IDs

CIX Sky1 firmware (SSDT) describes the discrete SPI TPM children as
SPT0001 (TP0 on SPI0) and SPT0002 (TP1 on SPI1), with SpiSerialBusV2
resources.  tpm_tis_spi only matched SMO0768, so neither device could
bind even when the Cadence SPI controllers are enabled.  Add both ACPI
IDs; unpopulated instances simply fail to probe.

Signed-off-by: grimtickle-overlay <overlay@localhost>
---
 drivers/char/tpm/tpm_tis_spi_main.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/char/tpm/tpm_tis_spi_main.c
+++ b/drivers/char/tpm/tpm_tis_spi_main.c
@@ -340,6 +340,9 @@
 
 static const struct acpi_device_id acpi_tis_spi_match[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{"SMO0768", 0},
+	/* CIX Sky1 firmware describes the discrete SPI TPM as SPT000x. */
+	{"SPT0001", 0},
+	{"SPT0002", 0},
 	{}
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(acpi, acpi_tis_spi_match);
